  fhir:CodeSystem.description [ fhir:value "The classes of the L2BPMN layer of the SMART Guidelines knowledge graph. A node's `type` is one of these. Source: smart-base/L1/schemas/L2-BPMN.ts (migrated from smart-kg ontology/L2-BPMN/L2-BPMN.json)."] ;
